  "contentCreated": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "origin": "A Danish instruction-following dataset of 5 million multi-turn conversation examples, generated synthetically with Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507-FP8. Pipeline: 176 manual Danish seed prompts (adapted from English Self-Instruct seeds and EU Horizon TrustLLM crowdsourced prompts) -> Alpaca-recipe expansion to 1M with structured generation and MinHash deduplication -> grammar correction/translation to Danish -> quality-improvement rewrite -> 4 generations of Evol-Instruct -> adding 3 follow-up questions per example. Commercially usable under Apache 2.0. The largest single Danish source in Mimir, contributing 8.32B sampled tokens per epoch (11.81% of the corpus) at 4x repetition from a 2.08B-token base. Funded by the Danish Research Reserve (2025 national budget) as part of the Danish Foundation Models project (partners: Alexandra Institute, University of Copenhagen, Aarhus University, University of Southern Denmark).",
  "custodyChain": [
